+Use a fresh build with `-DLOTUS_SANITIZE=ON` for ASan/UBSan on the executable's
+C++ sources. The separate BLAKE3 C library and supplied secp library are unchanged.
+
+Tests bind only numeric localhost IPv4/IPv6 with explicit ephemeral port0;
+10604/10605/8331 are never configured and returned ports are checked. They cover
+nonblocking/close-on-exec flags, connect/accept/read/write/EOF, partial progress,
+WouldBlock, duplicate bind and preserved refused outputs, deadline/rollback/
+overflow, refused connection, moves and descriptor reuse after repeated Close,
+bounded backpressure, actual EPIPE survival without a SIGPIPE handler, and the
+existing Transport handshake plus exact application bytes over fragmented real
+TCP. Every wait and send loop has a fixed iteration/byte cap. Deadline branches
+are exercised when the OS reports the connection pending rather than already
+connected. EINTR mapping is reviewed source behavior; tests do not force kernel
+signal interruption. These are source/local-socket checks, not daemon acceptance,
+public peering, synchronization, consensus validation or a selected testnet.
